<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix J What This Says, and Does Not Say, to Prover Builders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Why is the transition in count rather than rate?</span></a></li>
