<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In Appendix J What This Says, and Does Not Say, to Prover Builders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Our system never hallucinates. Are we done?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In Appendix J What This Says, and Does Not Say, to Prover Builders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Our generator trains on its own certified output. Does the model cover that?</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
