<a href="#S1.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" title="Mathematics as structured strings. ‣ Related work ‣ Introduction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1.4</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:298%;">Appendix</span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Notation</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We collect the symbols used throughout. The conventions are those of <a href="#S2" title="The Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>; this
table is a reference, not a redefinition, and every entry points to the section where the
object is introduced.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Symbol</span></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Meaning</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">countable ground set of statements, fixed canonical order <math id="A1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\prec" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≺</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\prec</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="A1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math>-based <math id="A1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L[1\!\dots\!N]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.600em;" width="0.600em"><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L[1\!\dots\!N]</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">ambient <em id="A1.p2.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">formal</em> (verifiable) language; membership oracle is the proof checker</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><em id="A1.p2.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">valuable</em><span id="A1.p2.1.4.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> target language, <math id="A1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\subseteq F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H\subseteq F</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">pair model <math id="A1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(F_{i},H_{i})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(F_{i},H_{i})\}</annotation></semantics></math> (<a href="#S2.Thmtheorem3" title="Definition 2.3 (Pair model). ‣ The nested model: validity versus value ‣ The Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Definition</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.3</span></a>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒫</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">fiber over <math id="A1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>F</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F</annotation></semantics></math>: candidates <math id="A1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{H_{i}:F_{i}=F\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{H_{i}:F_{i}=F\}</annotation></semantics></math> sharing one ambient</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">a countable collection of candidate targets</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℋ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">candidates consistent with <math id="A1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{H^{\prime}:S_{t}\subseteq H^{\prime}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{H^{\prime}:S_{t}\subseteq H^{\prime}\}</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">S</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">seen-set: values enumerated by the adversary through round <math id="A1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">generator’s output at round <math id="A1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> (element-based, <math id="A1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{t}\notin S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{t}\notin S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.11.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">limit set <math id="A1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{a_{t}:t\geq 1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{a_{t}:t\geq 1\}</annotation></semantics></math> of all outputs over the run</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.12.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">revealed core: infinite <math id="A1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\subseteq H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\subseteq H</annotation></semantics></math> the adversary enumerates</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.13.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">lower density <math id="A1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\underline{d}(C,H)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\underline{d}(C,H)</annotation></semantics></math> of the core in the target</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\underline{d}(\cdot,\cdot),\ \overline{d}(\cdot,\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.627em">,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\underline{d}(\cdot,\cdot),\ \overline{d}(\cdot,\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.14.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">lower / upper prefix density (liminf / limsup of <math id="A1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lvert L^{\prime}\cap L[1\!\dots\!N]\rvert/N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.600em;" width="0.600em"><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lvert L^{\prime}\cap L[1\!\dots\!N]\rvert/N</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.15.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">coverage at truth <math id="A1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=\underline{d}(O\cap H,H)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=\underline{d}(O\cap H,H)</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">trichotomy</span></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.16.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">hallucination (<math id="A1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\notin F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\notin F</annotation></semantics></math>) / triviality (<math id="A1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\in F\setminus H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\in F\setminus H</annotation></semantics></math>) / valuable (<math id="A1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\in H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\in H</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p2.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><math id="A1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{trv}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">trv</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{trv}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p2.1.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.17.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">triviality rate through round <math id="A1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> (<a href="#S2.Thmtheorem5" title="Definition 2.5 (Error trichotomy). ‣ The nested model: validity versus value ‣ The Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Definition</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.5</span></a>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p2.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
