<span id="A5.p2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:93.2pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">KM membership queries to collection members <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kleinberg and Mullainathan, 2024</a>)</cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.p2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.25pt;padding-bottom:1.25pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">is <math id="A5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> in a named member of the collection</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.p2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.25pt;padding-bottom:1.25pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">internal to their algorithm; not a separate resource</span>
</span></td></tr>
