<td id="A5.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.25pt;padding-bottom:1.25pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:93.2pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">MOP: decidability of the generator’s own support <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kalavasis et al., 2025</a>)</cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.p2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.25pt;padding-bottom:1.25pt;">
