<span id="A5.p2.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="A5.p2.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">finitely many add nothing; infinitely many are strictly more powerful</span>
</span></td></tr>
