<span id="A9.T6.7.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T6.7.7.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">uniform / non-uniform generation</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A9.T6.7.7.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A9.T6.7.7.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:93.2pt;">
<span id="A9.T6.7.7.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T6.7.7.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">learning-theoretic landscape of generation</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A9.T6.7.8" class="ltx_tr">
