<span id="A9.T6.7.41.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T6.7.41.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">breadth; sound coverage; density coverage</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A9.T6.7.41.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A9.T6.7.41.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:93.2pt;">
<span id="A9.T6.7.41.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T6.7.41.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">verifier is not taste (fiber-wise Angluin); sound coverage iff verifier, in general; trivia dichotomy <math id="A9.T6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha/2</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math id="A9.T6.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\alpha/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\alpha/2</annotation></semantics></math>, jump <math id="A9.T6.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=</annotation></semantics></math> unrecorded mass</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
